# Non-model settings only. Model setup is done with `agent model` commands:
# `agent model add` saves providers/models (+ optional base URL for custom),
# `agent model use` selects the general or role model, and writes
# model_config.json in the data dir. API keys go to the OS keyring.

# AGENT_DATA_DIR=  (leave commented; empty would override the platform default)

# Project the agent works on (optional; `--project` on `agent run` overrides it).
# SOURCE_DIR=

# One-shot persistence preference (real persistence lands in Phase 8).
# PERSIST=0
